WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:03.430 --> 00:08.640
We're contacting the stores, the customers, the regulators,
and handling the distribution centre.

2
00:09.770 --> 00:10.850
Now for more hard work.

3
00:11.530 --> 00:13.510
We have three days to get control of this story.

4
00:15.490 --> 00:16.260
Farms.

5
00:17.730 --> 00:18.430
Packaging.

6
00:19.970 --> 00:21.890
Northwest distribution centre.

7
00:25.060 --> 00:26.080
And the stores.

8
00:31.720 --> 00:34.950
This is what you're going to need to concentrate on: E. coli.

9
00:36.420 --> 00:40.400
The northwest distribution centre is where it was found.

10
00:40.400 --> 00:44.200
But that doesn't mean that's where the contamination occurred.
— Maybe, maybe not.

11
00:44.200 --> 00:49.630
The stores we can eliminate —
because fortunately we got it before it got out there.

12
00:50.180 --> 00:51.300
Thankfully.

13
00:51.940 --> 00:53.700
So this is what we need to be looking at,

14
00:54.210 --> 00:58.200
and we need to be thorough, meticulous —
consider all the possibilities.

15
00:58.200 --> 01:00.600
I'll start with the packaging facility.

16
01:00.600 --> 01:04.400
You have to look at where the meat is prepped, packaged, stored — everything.
— Absolutely.

17
01:04.400 --> 01:07.600
Okay, I'll take the northwest distribution centre.
I'm very familiar with it.

18
01:07.600 --> 01:10.750
And I'll take the family farms that supply CarneCarne with beef.

19
01:10.820 --> 01:12.600
All five of them, right? — Yeah.

20
01:12.600 --> 01:16.400
Make every effort. Pull out every stop. No stone unturned.

21
01:16.400 --> 01:19.200
We'll go over it with a fine-tooth comb.

22
01:19.200 --> 01:23.460
I'll cover everything on the suppliers' side.
And reach out if you need support.

23
01:23.850 --> 01:25.150
Yes, no doubt.

24
01:25.570 --> 01:28.260
My team is ready. — Okay. Anything else?

25
01:29.410 --> 01:31.600
Okay, we'll reconvene on Friday.

26
01:31.600 --> 01:35.400
The survival of CarneCarne may depend on this press conference.

27
01:35.400 --> 01:39.400
So I've got some media to do and I'll be back and forth,
but don't feel like you need to wait on me for anything.

28
01:39.400 --> 01:42.270
You have my full confidence.
